# Bouncing Beebles' Mode$ CantBlockBy carries IsPresent$ Artifact.DefenderCtrl:
# StaticAbilityCantAttackBlock.cantBlockBy runs checkConditions first
# (StaticAbilityCantAttackBlock.java:216), so with no artifact on the
# defending side the static is off and Grizzly Bears blocks. Both 2/2s die.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 2=1
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
advance
